Aurora Borealis Coin

Aurora Borealis Coin (ABRS) is an independent open-source peer-to-peer blockchain network.

The Aurora Borealis network provides support for peer-to-peer transactions, mining, wallet functionality, blockchain validation and asset-related functionality.

Official ticker: ABRS

Official website:
https://auroraborealiscoin.com/

Pool / Explorer:
https://auroraborealiscoin.org/

Aurora Borealis Core is derived from earlier open-source blockchain projects, including Ravencoin Core and Bitcoin Core.

Existing upstream copyright and license notices are preserved in accordance with their respective licenses.

Aurora Borealis mainnet includes a consensus-enforced premine at block #1.

Founder allocation: 210,000,000 ABRS
Treasury allocation: 210,000,000 ABRS
Total premine: 420,000,000 ABRS
